+    // NOTE(apl-core fork): removed the "legacy AplUser file" cleanup that used to run here.
+    // It called getResourceFilePath('AplUser', id) with id = a server-generated uuidv4(), but
+    // that helper validates its `name` argument against ID_NAME_PATTERN
